        "description": "# These drivers are, you guessed it… **STUPID!** \nThey need your help. \nUsing Hand Tracking or Controllers, select their vehicles to change speed and guide them as they merge into the flow of traffic. But be careful, these cars can’t stop… if there’s a collision, it’s all over.\n\nPerfect for casual players, but also offering optional challenges for the purists.\nAdjustable playing position to get you right down into the action and, for a more immersive experience, try Mixed Reality Mode.\n\nDesigned to be one of the most challenging **\"One More Go\"** games around, it features. \n\n- Mixed Reality Mode\t\n- Hand Tracking\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n- Cute, polished art style and animations\n- Catchy original soundtrack\n- Simple easy to learn gameplay\n- Unique, challenging levels\n- Adjustable playing position\n- Leaderboards to compete with the world or friends\n- 10 achievements for those perfectionists looking for an extra challenge\n- With great risk, comes great reward. Play with “Turbo” and “Overtake” modes.",
